rh43/im_balance.py — the Im-balance mirror of the equal-split question
convention:  S = i*t  with t real, so Im(S) = t;  Im S_N(t) = -sum_{n>=2} sin(t log n)
mpmath 1.3.0, working precision 60 dps (certificates: ivmath.Num, 400 dps)

